// Event versions may have legitimate gaps because consumers subscribe to a subset.
// Immutable facts deduplicate by event_id plus business identity, regardless of order.
// Mutable projections use monotonic aggregate_version CAS to reject stale overwrite.
// Dependent effects require explicit predecessor facts/receipts; missing dependencies
